{"q":"628","t":"Maximum Product of Three Numbers","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>You are given an integer array <code>nums</code>.</p>\n\n<p>Find three numbers whose product is <strong>maximum</strong> and return the <strong>maximum</strong> product.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">nums = [1,2,3]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">6</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The only three numbers are 1, 2, and 3, so the maximum product is <code>1 * 2 * 3 = 6</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">nums = [1,2,3,4]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">24</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The largest product comes from the three greatest numbers: <code>2 * 3 * 4 = 24</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">nums = [-1,-2,-3]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">-6</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The only three numbers are -1, -2, and -3, so the maximum product is <code>(-1) * (-2) * (-3) = -6</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>3 &lt;= nums.length &lt;=&nbsp;10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-1000 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"maximumProduct\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"}],"s":[{"t":"Maximum Product Subarray","s":"maximum-product-subarray","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Product of Three Elements After One Replacement","s":"maximum-product-of-three-elements-after-one-replacement","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Salesforce","salesforce"],["tcs","tcs"],["Redfin","redfin"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Apple","apple"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Intuit","intuit"],["Siemens","siemens"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",8],["Google","google",7],["tcs","tcs",4],["Redfin","redfin",4],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",3],["Salesforce","salesforce",2]],"b":[["Microsoft","microsoft",4]],"m":[["Meta","facebook",5],["TikTok","tiktok",4],["Apple","apple",3],["Intuit","intuit",3],["Nvidia","nvidia",2]]}}